{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065370/extras/1ca1cc24624571809829fee01799fed2.webp?t=1769027547\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065370/extras/1ca1cc24624571809829fee01799fed2.poster.avif?t=1769027547\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=669 /></picture></span>Play as Woj to run a successful vintage clothing store in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a teleporter to different decades &amp; places on Earth to buy inventory and try to match your customer wants for the most profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start the day with an innovative deckbuilding approach of heirachal card playing to gain resources, alter gameplay mechanics and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop &amp; nurture relationships with troubled celebrities to design special clothing.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out your store with equipment and design it your way.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065370?t=1769027547","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065370?t=1769027547","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065370/4a27022e887f61ed45fc16b03c912ce471a76f49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769027547","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065370/4a27022e887f61ed45fc16b03c912ce471a76f49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769027547","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065370/extras/1ca1cc2462